# Infinity Primary Theme

- Use `infinity-primary` utilities for primary UI accents in storefront, super-admin, and shared packages.
- Prefer `bg-infinity-primary`, `text-infinity-primary`, `border-infinity-primary`, and `ring-infinity-primary` for main actions, links, icons, and focus states.
- Use `infinity-primary-light`, `infinity-primary-dark`, and `infinity-primary-lighter/*` for hover, active, and soft backgrounds.
- Do not reintroduce `pink-*` utilities or mapped pink hex values for UI chrome.
- Keep semantic exceptions: destructive red/rose states, blue `text-actions-link`, product color swatches, chart series palettes, and Infinitygram mobile bottom nav center button (social blue gradient + `/Infinity.svg`).

## Loading UI (parity with `@repo/social`)

Reference: [`apps/social/src/components/ui/SuspenseLoader.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/ui/SuspenseLoader.tsx)

- **Page / suspense spinner:** `border-2 border-slate-200 border-t-infinity-primary` (size via `h-* w-*`).
- **Spinner glow:** `bg-infinity-primary/10 blur-xl` behind the ring.
- **Progress bar track:** `h-1.5 w-52 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-neutral-100`.
- **Progress bar fill:** `animate-auth-loader-slide rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-infinity-primary to-slate-400`.
- **Keyframe:** `@keyframes auth-loader-slide` + `.animate-auth-loader-slide` in [`apps/frontend/src/app/globals.css`](apps/frontend/src/app/globals.css) (same as social).
- **Route navigation bar:** [`NavigationProgress`](packages/ui/src/navigation-progress.tsx) — `bg-gradient-to-l from-[#334155] via-[#33415e] to-[#aebfdb]`.
- **API fetch top bar:** [`TopProgressBar`](apps/frontend/src/components/ui/TopProgressBar.tsx) uses the same NavigationProgress gradient + `animate-auth-loader-slide`.
- Do not use inline `style jsx` loader animations or pink/purple/rose bar gradients (`to-rose-300`, `via-purple-500`, etc.).

## Decorative CTA gradients (social blue)

For banners, 404 CTAs, wallet cards, and primary pill buttons outside `@repo/ui` Button:

- **Default:** `bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#566D97_0%,#98BDFF_100%)]`
- **Hover overlay:** `bg-[linear-gradient(70.36deg,#3E5070_10.29%,#A0C2FF_74.27%)]`
- **Text gradients:** `from-infinity-primary via-infinity-primary-light to-infinity-primary`
- **Soft backgrounds:** `from-slate-50 via-infinity-primary-lighter/20 to-slate-100` (not `rose-50` / `rose-100`)

## Sale badges

Use `bg-infinity-primary` or `bg-infinity-primary-dark` for discount percentage badges — not `bg-rose-600`.
